       components use Box, hierarchy objects use Cube.
       Icon.SceneObject is the only Regular style glyph (Cube Regular); the rest are Filled.
       Icon.CSharp only ships at 16px. Icon.Scene layers the filled Filmstrip frame with the play triangle.
       Render them with PathIcon so they follow Foreground and stay sharp on any DPI. -->
